* 极限：变化率跟踪。R 10k->120k 在 10us 内完成
.inc models.inc
V1 ta 0 3.3
Rtop ta t 10k
Rb t 0 150k
Rsamp t sn R={10k+110k*V(ctl)}
Vctl ctl 0 PWL(0 0 5m 0 5.01m 1 20m 1)
Rk1 sn x 2
Vsm x dd 0
M1 dd g b b nmosb
Rs b 0 150k
R1 vset ta 360k
R2 vset 0 200k
Xop vset b ta 0 g opa333t
B_rtrue r_true 0 V={10k+110k*V(ctl)}
B_rmeas r_meas 0 V={(V(t)-V(sn))/V(b)*150k}
B_rerr r_err 0 V={(V(r_meas)-V(r_true))/V(r_true)*100}
.tran 0 20m 0 0.5u
.options method=gear
.end
